BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Enchanted Harvest Market at Griffo Distillery in Partnership With 
 Trellus
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T190000
UID:261016riSZT76vRU-AehK87mRmFw
DESCRIPTION:Come support local makers at this fun-filled\, FREE event!\n\n
 🍂 Enchanted Harvest Market\n\nPresented by Griffo Distillery & Trellus 
 Marketplace\n\nStep into the magic of the season at Griffo Distillery for 
 the Enchanted Harvest Market\, where local creativity\, live music\, and h
 arvest-season charm come together for an afternoon of community.\n\nThis F
 REE festive\, all-ages event features an eclectic lineup of local makers\,
  unique handmade treasures\, delicious treats\, live music\, a pet costume
  contest\, and more!\n\nWander the market\, sip one of Griffo's spirited f
 all cocktails\, and soak up the magic of the season. Whether you're huntin
 g for one-of-a-kind gifts\, enjoying an afternoon of music\, or showing of
 f your four-legged friend's Halloween-worthy look\, there's something for 
 everyone.\n\n🍁What's Happening: Enchanted Harvest Market\n\nWhen: Satur
 day\, October 17 | 2–7 PM\n\nWhere: Griffo Distillery | Petaluma\, CA\n\
 nPlease RSVP for this FREE\, All Ages Event.\n\n✨ Some of your featured 
 makers include:\n\nHippie Hula Candle Co. — Candles and aromatic finds\n
 \nThunder Buddy Ranch Silver — Silver jewelry and accessories\n\nRiver a
 nd Vine Studio — Artful\, creative goods\n\nSonoma Chocolatiers — Choc
 olate and sweet treats\n\nTechnicolor Dino — Colorful\, imaginative crea
 tions\n\nBotanica Essentia -- Luxury Skincare\n\n🎶 The Magic Doesn't St
 op There\n\nLive Music — Enjoy the sounds of the season while you explor
 e.\n\nPet Costume Contest — Bring your best-dressed furry friends for a 
 little friendly competition and plenty of cuteness.\n\nCraft Cocktails & M
 ore — Enjoy the Griffo experience while spending an afternoon with frien
 ds\, family\, and fellow market lovers.\n\nGather your favorite people\, d
 ress for the season\, and come ready to explore. From handmade treasures t
 o furry little fashion icons\, the Enchanted Harvest Market is where autum
 n magic meets local love.\n\nCome for the market. Stay for the music. Leav
 e Enchanted!
LOCATION:Griffo Distillery
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/griffo-trellus-present-enchanted-harvest-
 market-tickets-2003310488599?aff=ebdssbdestsearch
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
