 aton Road\, Downtown Graton\, CA. Invite your friends\, family and neighbo
 rs. Enjoy live music\, plants\, Luncheon\, coffee and desserts\, Raffle pr
 izes\, white elephant gifts\, quilts\, garden art... something for everyon
 e! All are welcome\, always FREE admission. NEW THIS YEAR - help support o
 ur local schhol's Art Teachers! If you have gently used or new art + craft
  supplies you no longer want\, please bring them to the Flower Show on Oct
 .16-17! We will be accepting art/craft supply donations which will later b
 e given to the art teachers at OakGrove + Willowside Schools. The GCC buil
 ding is ADA accessible and child friendly. We look forward to seeing you t
 here! The Club is a nonprofit 501(c) 3\, tax ID #94-6093957. Since 1954\, 
 sales have benefited local student scholarships.
LOCATION:Graton Community Club
URL:https://gratoncommunityclub.org
