UID:260915lOfmmY2BP0-9UqdGlDMppA
DESCRIPTION:*Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come 
 together.*\n\nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a ta
 sting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acr
 oss the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll 
 and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new so
 unds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n**Take 3 Jazz Trio**\n\nTake 3
  Jazz Trio is an all-women Bay Area ensemble performing tunes from the Gre
 at American Song Book. We play a mix of uplifting swing tunes\, smooth Lat
 in tunes\, and soulful blues and ballads. Michele Korb is our vocalist/gui
 tarist. Susanne DiVincenzo is on bass. Barb Raboy plays clarinet\, sax\, a
 nd flute.\n\n**Details**\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this even
 t tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are 
 dog and family friendly!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/events/live-music-at-spicy-vines-13/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
