SUMMARY:Harvest Fiesta at Sculpterra Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T000000
UID:261011IC86chzUiEadv6kKjHb_UA
DESCRIPTION:2026 Harvest Fiesta at Sculpterra Winery celebrates the harves
 t season and the hardworking people who make it possible. Enjoy a festive 
 afternoon with delicious food from La Parrilla\, Choco’s Tacos\, and Pat
 agonia Hotdogs\, along with pours of Héroe Wine.    Experience traditiona
 l dance performances by Ballet Folklórico Flor de Luna and lively music f
 rom DJ 805. The celebration also partners with Flying Samaritans and featu
 res special guest speakers\, adding a meaningful community-focused element
  to the festivities.    With free admission for all\, the Harvest Fiesta i
 s a fun-filled way to gather with friends and family\, enjoy great food an
 d wine\, and celebrate the spirit of the harvest.
URL:https://www.winecountry.com/event/harvest-fiesta-at-sculpterra-winery/
