BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Book Launch With Sonoma County Author Karen Gebbia
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T130000
UID:260924XOqiqQ9orkWZJ93aBroeuA
DESCRIPTION:**You can't rush real iced tea.** Charlotte wants to wait pati
 ently. She really does. But waiting is hard\, especially on a stifling Mar
 yland morning\, when her t-shirt feels like a hot\, heavy blanket\, and sh
 e can't think of anything but Nana's cold\, sweet\, lemony\, real iced tea
 .\n\nThere are so many steps to Nana's secret recipe tea! Steeping\, sugar
 ing\, cooling . . . baking muffins to go with it! Nana tells her to find s
 omething useful to do while she waits\, so Charlotte sweeps\, and swings\,
  and snaps pillowcases\, but it still isn't ready!\n\nCharlotte has to fin
 d more things to do to pass the time\, and soon she finds that a day spent
  waiting can be a day spent enjoying the slower moments. Sometimes the swe
 etest things in life are the things we have to wait for\, and learning to 
 savor them slowly is a joy all its own. Included is a reader's note for ad
 ults on helping kids learn how to wait and a secret recipe to try at home.
 \n\nScavenger Hunt and Stickers for the kiddos.
LOCATION:Russian River Books & Letters
URL:https://www.booksletters.com/events/book-launch-with-sonoma-county-aut
 hor-karen-gebbia
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
