UID:260820Jo-bKkn-Zk67WbWL3BTvxw
DESCRIPTION:An oracle charm class utilizing rounded glass is an immersive\
 , hands-on workshop where students blend artistic crafting with personal 
 intuition to design custom divination tools. The class focuses on creatin
 g glass cabochon charms—smooth\, flat-backed\, dome-fronted glass —tha
 t magnify hand-drawn symbols\, hidden images\, or mystical sigils undernea
 th.  There will also be a choice of images to use.  The workshop conclud
 es placing completed glass oracles into velvet pouches\, learn casting te
 chniques\, and practice performing your first readings for one another.\n\
 n October 18\n\n1pm-3pm
LOCATION:Spellcraft Curator
URL:https://bookeo.com/spellcraftcurator?type=3152PXNKWU1A01AAF8220
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
