BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Symphony Pops: A Tribute to John Williams\, The Movie Maestro
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T150000
UID:261009CRifjXPw006UAOfM9ZF4rw
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\nSymphony Pops\n\nA Tribute to John Willia
 ms\, The Movie Maestro\n\nTroy Quinn\, Pops Conductor \n\nSunday\, October
  18\, 2026\n\n3:00 pm\n\n2:00 pm pre-show discussion\n\nIndividual tickets
  on sale Aug 18 for LBC Members\; Aug 21 for the public. \n\n \n\nRelive t
 he magic of the movies as the Symphony Pops celebrates the legendary music
  of composer John Williams. A Tribute to John Williams\, The Movie Maestro
  brings to life the unforgettable scores that have shaped generations of f
 ilm lovers\, from the swashbuckling fun of Hook and the heroic sweep of Su
 perman to the wonder of E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial. Journey to galaxies fa
 r\, far away with music from Star Wars\, feel the patriotic power of the t
 heme from The Patriot\, and thrill to the iconic sounds of Jurassic Park
 —all performed live in a concert packed with cinematic excitement. \n\nG
 enerous support provided by Nancy & Michael Hall and the Heck Foundation. 
 \n\nSymphony Pops Series\n\nSee the full series here: Symphony Pops Series
  \n\nSeason ticket packages are available ONLINE now\, or by downloading t
 he form and sending the completed form to us by mail or email. See details
  on the form. If you have any questions\, call the Patron & Member Service
 s Office at 707.546.3600. Order today to get the best seats! \n\nRenew onl
 ine\n\nDownload New Subscription Form\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\n\nDon
 ’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets a
 nd then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase a
 nd guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us
 : through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plu
 s\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by p
 hone or at the box office to provide customer support.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/the-movie-maestro/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
