DESCRIPTION:Learn how to make wines from apples\, apricots\, berries\, nec
 tarines\, peaches\, pears\, persimmons\, plums and even lemons!\n\nPresent
 er: Vi Epperson\, an amateur winemaker since 2014 who has produced over 80
 0 bottles of wine. She uses a non-tech kitchen-oriented approach to winema
 king. If you can follow a recipe\, you can learn to make wine. She will de
 monstrate the preparation\, home equipment\, ingredients\, fermentation st
 eps\, bottling and labeling of fruit wines. Winetasting will follow (Must 
