UID:260825m6EitTjzmE-emmIVux2QRA
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Osmosis Meditation Garden with Its Founder on W
 ednesday\, October 21st \n\nJoin the founder and lead gardener of Osmosis 
 for a guided journey through our landmark meditation garden — an intimat
 e event limited to just 12 guests. \n\nDiscover the artistry and intention
  behind one of Osmosis’s most beloved spaces as we explore the principle
 s of Japanese garden design: the carefully chosen plantings\, distinctive 
 pruning styles\, and deliberate placement of stone. At the heart of the ga
 rden lies its foundation — an ancient Zen story told entirely through st
 one arrangements. \n\nThis is a rare opportunity to see the garden through
