 n\nCeramics\, Extended Classes\, Handcrafted for the Holidays\n\nExperienc
 e Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n17\\+\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$265\n\nMa
 terials Fee:\n\n$30\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$295\n\nThis 8 week ses
