BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sound Healing with Horses
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T183000
UID:261008z58Y2yOyKkqyO8pqn9G2kg
DESCRIPTION:**Sound Healing with Horses**\n\nAs the sun begins to set over
  the ranch\, join us for a peaceful evening of sound healing in the presen
 ce of the horses.\n\nThis unique experience invites you to slow down\, bre
 athe deeply\, and receive the calming medicine of sound while surrounded b
 y the quiet wisdom of these remarkable animals. As crystal singing bowls\,
  chimes\, and other healing instruments fill the space\, the horses will b
 e free to interact naturally\, offering their own gentle presence and ener
 gy throughout the experience.\n\nWhether you're seeking relaxation\, emoti
 onal renewal\, or simply a chance to reconnect with yourself and nature\, 
 this evening offers a beautiful opportunity to unwind and experience heali
 ng in a truly unique setting.\n\nNo experience is necessary\, simply come 
 with an open heart.\n\n**What to Bring**\n\nClosed-toe shoes\n\nComfortabl
 e clothing for the weather\n\nYoga Mat\, Blanket & Pillow (if desired\, fo
 r extra comfort)\n\nWater bottle\n\nAll participants will be required to s
 ign a **liability release form upon arrival** (if you haven't already bee
 n on the property).\n\n***Meet & greet the horses afterward and enjoy some
  hot tea!***\n\n**MORE DETAIL TO NOTE**\n\nSpace is limited to help create
  an intimate and peaceful experience.\n\nSince this will be a chillier tim
 e of year\, the experience will be held in the stables with the horses. Th
 ere will be mini horses roaming in the experience for some closer contact.
 \n\n**Thursday\, October 22\, 2026** *\\*\\*Arrive by 4:40-4:45PM to set u
 p your area on the floor.*\n\n**Starts 5:00 PM** **Belos Cavalos** 687 Cam
 pagna Lane Kenwood\, CA 95452\n\n**$65-75 per person** **45-minute experie
 nce**\n\n**\\*\\*Tickets are non-refundable\, but can be transferred if no
 tified enough in advance.**\n\nSound Healer: Chris Young-Ginzburg of Grove
  Circle Healing\n\nwww.grovecirclehealing.com\n\ngrovecirclehealing@gmail.
 com
LOCATION:Belos Cavalos
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1993872882465?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
