DESCRIPTION:The Grove Restaurant invites you to the monthly Winemaker Dinn
 er Series\, an intimate\, four-course dining experience where the artistry
  of Napa Valley’s finest winemakers meets the culinary excellence of the
  Culinary Institute of America. This is a rare opportunity to enjoy a menu
  thoughtfully curated by CIA Executive Chef Chris\, paired with exceptiona
 l selections from the featured producers' portfolio.  \n\nWinery Spotlig
 ht: On Thursday\, October 22\, join us as we proudly partner with Domaine 
 Carneros and welcome the winemaker behind the bottle.
