DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T200000
UID:261012fblgRjSLDE2Z2EucDTwxrg
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of spooktacular fun at the Children’
 s Museum of Sonoma County! Family FUNtaz Night\, Thursday & Friday\, Oct
 ober 22 & 23\, 4:30pm to 8:00pm is the perfect way to celebrate spooky se
 ason. Come for thrills\, giggles\, and plenty of memory-making with your f
 amily! \n\nMore information on the Family FUN Nights page!\n\nHere’s wha
 t’s brewing: \n\n🍺 Tasty brews and Local wines for the grown-ups \\(a
 vailable for purchase\\)\n\n🍔 Delicious eats from local food trucks \\(
 available for purchase\\)\n\n🎶 Rockin’ tunes\n\n🎨 Hands-on spooky 
 crafts\, creepy science experiments\, and silly surprises from our classic
  FUNtazmagoria weekend\n\n👻 Costumes encouraged—kids\, parents\, and 
 even grandparents\, come dressed in your Halloween best!\n\nBring the whol
 e family for a magical evening of pumpkins\, potions\, music\, and mayhem
 ! \n\n \n\nNote: Classic FUNtazmagoria is transforming in 2026 and 2027 as
  the Children’s Museum undergoes its exciting expansion project. During 
 this time\, we invite families to join us for two evenings of Family FUNta
 z Night\, on Thursday & Friday\, October 22 & 23\, 4:30pm to 8:00pm!
LOCATION:Children's Museum of Sonoma County
URL:https://www.cmosc.org/event/family-funtaz-night/2026-10-22/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
