DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\nFea
 turing Used Goods & Dino’s Greek Food Truck\n\nJoin us for a relaxed and
  lively Friday night at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located i
 n downtown Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and fr
 esh Mediterranean flavors. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the feel-go
 od\, crowd-friendly sounds of Used Goods with classic Greek favorites from
  Dino’s Greek Food Truck.\n\nUsed Goods brings an upbeat mix of familiar
  tunes and crowd favorites\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a social 
 evening surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’
 s wines by the glass or bottle while Dino’s Greek Food Truck serves flav
 orful gyros and traditional Greek dishes\, made fresh on site.\n\nFriday |
  5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 event i
 nside the Barrel Room. Under-21 guests and leashed pets are welcome on the
  patio only.\n\nCome grab a seat early and enjoy a classic Sonoma County n
 ight of great music\, great wine\, and great food.\n\nWine available for p
 urchase Live music by Used Goods Food by Dino’s Greek Food Truck \\(Gree
 k cuisine and gyros\\) Location: Longboard Vineyards Barrel Room Address: 
 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
