UID:261015pvXHtVhx00qjyhA7iKSFkQ
DESCRIPTION:Let your creativity burn! Join us inside **The Lounge at Mercy
 ** for an afternoon of crafting\, chill vibes\, and good company. This mon
 th we're trinket-maxxing and making our own Bong Charms and Tote Bag Charm
 s. Bring your own tote bag or purse to decorate\, or grab a new bag from o
 ne of our Mercy brand partners to customize!\n\nBe ready for beading\, rhi
 nestones\, fabric paint and more. Come for the crafts\, stay for the vibes
 . **Craft\, chill\, and express yourself — Mercy style.**\n\n**Date & Ti
 me**\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, October 25\, 2026\n\n**Time:** 3:00 - 6:00 PM\n
 \n**What’s Included**\n\nAll craft supplies\n\nGood vibes\n\nA cannabis-
 friendly lounge to spark your creativity\n\n**Ticket Tiers**\n\n**$20 - EA
 RLY BIRD GA:** All supplies provided. Early bird pricing while supplies la
 st. \n\n**$25 - General Admission:** All materials and supplies included.
 \n\n**$30 - Crafting + Sesh Starter (Joint) -** All materials and supplies
  included plus enjoy a 1g preroll to kick off your sesh while you create.\
 n\n**$35 - Crafting + Sesh Starter (Extract) -** All materials and supplie
 s included plus one 1g concentrate for guests who want a stronger lift whi
 le they craft and chill.\n\n**$35 - Crafting + Sesh Starter (Flower) -** A
 ll materials and supplies included and enjoy 1g of flower to elevate the c
 reative session.\n\n**$35 - Crafting + Sesh Starter (Vape) -** All materia
 ls and supplies included plus an all-in-one vape to enjoy during the event
 .\n\n**⭐ $50 - Crafting + Flower Flight -** All materials and supplies 
 included plus a 3-gram flower tasting flight (three 1g selections) to expl
 ore while you craft and chill.\n\n21+ Only | DCC # C12-0000420-LIC\n\n**Ev
 ent Terms & Conditions**\n\nThis event is 21+ only. Valid government-issue
 d ID is required for entry. By attending this event at the Mercy Wellness 
 Lounge\, you acknowledge that photography and video recording may take pla
 ce. Images and footage may be used by Mercy Wellness for marketing and pro
 motional purposes across various channels\, without compensation. Tickets 
 are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event details\, timing\, or pr
 ogramming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consumption is limited to des
 ignated areas and must comply with all applicable local and state regulati
 ons. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venue\, you agree to c
 omply with all house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy 
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/mercy-presents-craft-and-chill-102526-15198
