 iding challah from start to finish\, discover the deeper meaning behind it
 s ingredients\, and take home tips and a recipe card to continue the tradi
 tion in your own kitchen.\n\nHear from a local breast cancer thriver and c
 ome together in support of the women in our community — those who have f
 aced breast cancer\, those walking that journey today\, and those who stan
 d beside them. A portion of the proceeds will benefit Sharsheret\, support
 ing women and families facing breast and ovarian cancer.
