DESCRIPTION:**Sing\, Laugh\, Defend Democracy**\n\n**Join us Sunday\, Octo
 ber 25 at 3:00 PM for an entertaining and thought-provoking afternoon in s
 upport of independent community radio. Roy Zimmerman brings his signature 
 blend of political satire\, hilarious storytelling\, and memorable origina
 l songs to the Inn at Occidental for a special benefit performance support
 ing KOWS Community Radio.With humor that is incisive\, timely\, and hopefu
 l\, Roy takes on politics\, social justice\, and the state of democracy—
 inviting audiences to sing\, laugh\, and leave a little more inspired.** *
 "Roy's lyrics move beyond poetry and achieve perfection\," said Joni Mitch
 ell.*
