BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Halloween Activities & Graveyard Stroll
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T183000
UID:261012rObzxDfwz020SVfq8j-ljg
DESCRIPTION:Join Open Space Rangers for an exciting\, spooky family Hallow
 een event! The festivities will run from 6:30 to 7:30 PM and include fun a
 ctivities and a photo booth. The East Bay Vivarium will be on site with cr
 eepy animals\, offering a chance to see them up close and learn fascinatin
 g facts. At 7:30 PM\, we will embark on an interactive Graveyard Stroll fe
