DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T180000
UID:26051949RQ54lYIE-2MuzeZyzOIQ
DESCRIPTION:Blippi is coming to your hometown in the all-new Be Like Blipp
 i Tour! Get ready to see the world more curiously as you move like\, play 
 like\, and explore just like Blippi! Join Blippi and Meekah. live on stage
  in a high-energy live show packed with music\, laughter\, and surprises\,
  featuring fan-favorites like "The Excavator Song\," "Monster Truck\," "Di
 no Dance\," and "Curious Like Me." This brand-new interactive adventure in
