DESCRIPTION:Join the Joe Mesics' Literary Canon book club! This month we a
 re reading *Labyrinths* by Jorge Luis Borges\, and discussion will be led 
 by guest speaker Prof. Gene Bell-Villada\, the Harry C. Payne Professor of
  Romance Languages at Williams College.\n\nProfessor Gene Bell-Villada has
  thoughtfully chosen a subset of the pieces from Borges’ collection *Lab
 yrinths* he’d like to concentrate on\, as well as a list of questions to
