BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Michelle Lambert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T163000
UID:2610120_CqV2MkTku_3yMExrXivA
DESCRIPTION:Join Michelle Lambert at Adobe Road Wines new outdoor courtyar
 d in downtown Petaluma. More info available here: https://adoberoadwines.c
 om/visit/\n\nBay Area breakout artist Michelle Lambert delivers a fun\, hi
 gh-energy show filled with edgy\, heartfelt original music\, infectious po
 p hooks\, and unstoppable charisma. Fresh off a successful 40-date tour ac
 ross the Western states last year\, Michelle captivates audiences with soa
 ring vocals\, dynamic violin solos\, and vibrant energy that radiates thro
 ugh the crowd. Her electrifying performances create an unforgettable live 
 experience that will have you dancing\, smiling\, and celebrating all nigh
 t long.\n\nRaised in Northern California and trained at the prestigious Be
 rklee College of Music\, Michelle Lambert has forged her own path as a fea
 rless\, independent pop artist. She has topped the charts of Indie Radio w
 ith her original songs and was featured in the San Francisco Giants’ Cit
 y Connect Campaign as a notable Bay Area artist. Michelle cut her teeth pe
 rforming and writing in the competitive music scenes of Nashville and Los 
 Angeles before returning to the Bay Area to tour with her own thriving car
 eer. Known for her powerful vocals\, masterful violin playing\, and bold\,
  colorful costumes\, Michelle pairs striking visuals with raw emotional st
 orytelling—embodying creativity\, resilience\, and the adventure of chas
 ing your dreams. For more info on Michelle visit: https://www.michellelamb
 ert.com
LOCATION:Adobe Road Winery
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108956417?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
