BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jazz Mafia & Adam Theis & Adam Klipple's Organ Soul Explosion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T190000
UID:261016AHyEcq0ajkiHll3HmlPyQw
DESCRIPTION:B3BONE brings the deep grooves and raw energy of the classic o
 rgan combo to The Lounge at Mercy Wellness on December 3rd. Featuring Adam
  Klipple on Hammond B3\, Adam Theis on trombone\, and Henry Plumb on drums
 \, the trio digs into funk\, soul and jazz with plenty of room for improvi
 sation and spontaneous musical conversation.\n\nWith Klipple handling ever
 ything from deep bass lines to swirling organ textures\, Theis bringing th
 e bone and Plumb driving the pocket\, B3BONE is all about groove\, interpl
 ay and three musicians stretching the music in real time. Come hang with u
 s at The Lounge for a night of heavy B3\, brass and beats.
