 wn Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and bold stree
 t-style food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the high-energy\, crowd-
 pleasing sounds of Highway 12 Band with the flavorful dishes of Lila’s S
 treetside Eats.\n\nHighway 12 Band brings a fun mix of danceable hits and 
 familiar favorites\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a relaxed and soc
 ial evening surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboar
 d’s wines by the glass or bottle while Lila’s Streetside Eats serves f
 resh\, creative street food made to order and packed with flavor.\n\nFrida
 y | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 even
