DESCRIPTION:Join North Bay Children’s Center \\(NBCC\\) for our 2nd Annu
 al Fall Festival & Community Open House! Bring the whole family for a FREE
  day of fall fun\, hands-on activities\, and community connections!\n\nExp
 lore our campus\, meet local community resource partners\, and enjoy excit
