 stings\n\n🌱 Garden of Eatin’® activities\n\n🎁 Kids Kitchen kit an
 d STEAM Pack giveaways\n\nSaturday\, November 7\, 2026 | 10 AM–1 PM\n\nL
 ocation: NBCC’s Al & Lisa Brayton Campus in Novato\n\nThis event is FREE
