DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T190000
UID:261015Ew6qKyv9LUajBXdiND0rrg
DESCRIPTION:The Power of Storytelling in Troubling Times\n\nWe will explor
 e storytelling as a creative way to wield the liberating power of the Dhar
 ma in our daily lives\, especially in these troubling times.  \n\nDrawin
 g on the lifelong commitments of Paula Arai’s research-based writing as 
 a contemplative practice and Kathie Fischer’s focus on Zen practice in d
 omestic and monastic modes\, we will invite people to help us create our o
 wn community story about wielding the compassionate teaching of the Dharma
  in these times.
LOCATION:The Glaser Center
URL:https://events.humanitix.com/https-events-humanitix-com-timely-wisdom-
 2026
