 hen people gather\, share stories\, and truly connect. This wine and food 
 experience is served family-style\, featuring wines from across our portfo
 lio. Each course is designed to inspire exploration and play\, encouraging
  you to mix\, match and savor. You may even uncover an unexpected favorite
  along the way and an idea you can bring home with you!\n\nThis experience
  is offered Thursday through Sunday.\n\nMENU:\n\nGATHER\n\n2021 Goldeneye 
 Brut Rosé\n\nHeirloom Tomato Mosaic Salad\n\nWhole Milk Ricotta\, Basil &
  Crispy Prosciutto\n\nPairing: 2024 Duckhorn Huichica Hills Chardonnay\n\n
 Zucchini Linguine "Succotash"\n\nSmokey Bacon\, Sweet Corn & Summer Beans\
 n\nPairing: 2023 Goldeneye Confluence Pinot Noir\n\nGRAZE\n\nGrilled Wagyu
  Beef Loin\n\nEggplant Baba Ghanoush & Cucumber Tzatziki\n\nPairing: 2022 
 Paraduxx Block 5 Blend\n\nRigatoncini Pasta\n\nBasil-Walnut Pesto\n\nPairi
 ng: 2022 Duckhorn Stout Merlot\n\nSAVOR\n\nExtra Virgin Olive Oil Cake\n\n
 Strawberry Black Pepper Compote & Gelato\n\nPairing: 2021 Calera Viognier 
 Doux\n\n- Please note this is a 21 and over experience\n\n- Group size: 2-
 6 guests﻿﻿\n\n- Duration: Please allow 90-120 minutes for this experie
 nce
LOCATION:The Duckhorn Collection
URL:https://www.theduckhorncollection.com/pages/culinary
