UID:261009QV-iS8WDw0WlE4d30h2D6g
DESCRIPTION:Discover the elegance of Sonoma wine country as Matanzas Creek
  Winery joins the  Winemaker Dinner Series at Inn at the Tides . Guests wi
 ll enjoy beautifully paired wines and a specially curated seasonal menu in
