DESCRIPTION:Join us for a relaxed and social paint &amp\; sip evening. You
 'll be guided step-by-step through painting a scenic view using acrylics\,
  with plenty of room to make it your own. \n\nWhether you follow along or 
 add your own creative twist\, the focus is on enjoying the process and hav
 ing fun. Sip on a beverage\, come with friends or meet new ones\, and sett
 le into a laid-back night of painting and connection. No experience needed
  - just show up and create.\n\nGenevieve Elkin was Born and raised in Mill
  Valley\, California and is a multidisciplinary artist now based in Petalu
 ma. She earned a BFA in Illustration from Parsons School of Design and has
  professionally managed art departments\, supporting artists and new media
  on high-profile projects. Genevieve loves painting\, drawing\, and explor
 ing ceramics\, and enjoys helping students experiment\, have fun\, and dev
 elop their own creative voice.\n\nTo learn more:@gennaelkin\n\nSponsored b
 y 
