DESCRIPTION:**As part of its Live Music series\, Cloverdale Arts Alliance 
 hosts a monthly Blues Night on Second Saturdays\, 7:30-9:30pm at the CAA g
 allery!** Featuring an all-star lineup of local musicians from multiple ba
 nds that come together as the Blue Lights\, Blues Night serves up 2 solid 
